* 0.18um-style BSIM3v3.3 model cards for the rspice bsim3v3 oracle decks.
* Parameter values written for this test suite (not a foundry deck); they
* exercise the short-channel, DIBL, mobility, Rds(V) and CTM charge paths.
* Keep in sync with tests.rs::nmos018()/pmos018().

.model n018 nmos level=49
+ tnom=27 tox=4.1e-9 xj=1.0e-7 nch=2.35e17
+ vth0=0.37 k1=0.59 k2=0.0026 k3=1e-3 k3b=2.3 w0=1e-7 nlx=1.8e-7
+ dvt0w=0 dvt1w=0 dvt2w=0 dvt0=1.4 dvt1=0.41 dvt2=0.027
+ u0=270 ua=-1.4e-9 ub=2.4e-18 uc=6.2e-11 vsat=9.5e4
+ a0=1.9 ags=0.41 b0=-1e-8 b1=0 keta=0.04 a1=0 a2=1
+ rdsw=110 prwg=0.5 prwb=-0.2 wr=1 wint=5e-9 lint=1.5e-8
+ dwg=-4e-9 dwb=6e-9 voff=-0.092 nfactor=2.2 cit=0
+ cdsc=2.4e-4 cdscd=0 cdscb=0
+ eta0=2.5e-3 etab=5e-5 dsub=1.5e-2
+ pclm=0.72 pdiblc1=0.21 pdiblc2=2.5e-3 pdiblcb=-0.1 drout=0.78
+ pscbe1=8.5e8 pscbe2=5e-7 pvag=0.01 delta=0.01 rsh=0 mobmod=1
+ prt=0 ute=-1.5 kt1=-0.11 kt1l=0 kt2=0.022
+ ua1=4.31e-9 ub1=-7.61e-18 uc1=-5.6e-11 at=3.3e4
+ wl=0 wln=1 ww=0 wwn=1 wwl=0 ll=0 lln=1 lw=0 lwn=1 lwl=0
+ capmod=3 xpart=0.5 cgdo=7.9e-10 cgso=7.9e-10 cgbo=1e-12
+ cj=9.5e-4 pb=0.8 mj=0.38 cjsw=2.4e-10 pbsw=0.8 mjsw=0.13
+ cjswg=3.3e-10 pbswg=0.8 mjswg=0.13
+ cf=0 clc=1e-7 cle=0.6 voffcv=-0.02 noff=1.8 acde=0.6 moin=15
+ js=1.5e-6 jsw=2.5e-12 nj=1 xti=3

